msgstr "Ang Apprise API"

#: apprise_api/api/templates/welcome.html:12
msgid ""
"\n"
"      <a target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://github.com/caronc/apprise\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Apprise</a> allows you to send a notification to almost\n"
"      all of the most popular notification services available to us today such as: <em>Telegram</em>, <em>Discord</em>,\n"
"      <em>Slack</em>, <em>Amazon SNS</em>, <em>Gotify</em>, etc.\n"
"      This API provides a simple gateway to directly access it via an HTTP interface."
msgstr ""
"\n"
"<a target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://github.com/caronc/apprise\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Apprise</a> ay nagbibigay-daan sa iyo na magpadala ng notification sa halos lahat ng pinakapopular na serbisyo ng notification na magagamit sa atin ngayon tulad ng: <em>Telegram</em>, <em>Discord</em>, <em>Slack</em>, <em>Amazon SNS</em>, <em>Gotify</em>, atbp. Ang API na ito ay nagbibigay ng simpleng gateway upang direktang ma-access ito sa pamamagitan ng HTTP na interface."

#: apprise_api/api/templates/welcome.html:20
msgid ""
"This project was designed to be incredibly light\n"
"        weight."
msgstr "Ang proyektong ito ay idinisenyo upang maging napakagaan."

